  "solution": "Given equation: 11 ÷ 77 + 253 × 23 – 800 = 58.\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/d50192f098c21078501d30eeafe1a8c64bc30dd9621c48caa8a39ffc60f68b64.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) – and ÷\n\nGiven: 11 ÷ 77 + 253 × 23 – 800 = 58\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 11 - 77 + 253 × __**23 ÷ 800**__ = 58\n\n⇒ 11 - 77 + __**253 × **____0.03__ = 58\n\n⇒ __**11**__ - 77 __**+ 7.59**__ = 58\n\n⇒ __18.59** -**____** 77**__ = 58\n\n⇒ -58.41 ≠ 58\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 2) × and ÷**\n\nGiven: 11 ÷ 77 + 253 × 23 – 800 = 58\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ 11 × 77 + __253 ÷ 23__ – 800 = 58\n\n⇒ __**11 ×**____** 77**__ + 11 – 800 = 58\n\n⇒ __**847 + 11**__ – 800 = 58\n\n⇒ __**858**____** – 800**__ = 58\n\n⇒ **58 = 58**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS.**\n\nOption 3) + and –\n\nGiven: 11 ÷ 77 + 253 × 23 – 800 = 58\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**11 ÷ 77**__ - 253 × 23 + 800 = 58\n\n⇒ 0.14 - __**253 × 23**__ + 800 = 58\n\n⇒ __**0.14**__ - 5819 __**+ 800**__ = 58\n\n⇒ __**800.14 - 5819**__ = 58\n\n⇒ -5018.86 ≠ 58\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) – and ×\n\nGiven: 11 ÷ 77 + 253 × 23 – 800 = 58\n\nAfter interchanging the numbers we get;\n\n⇒ __**11 ÷ 77**__ + 253 - 23 × 800 = 58\n\n⇒ 0.14 + 253 - __**23 **____**×**____** 800**__ = 58\n\n⇒ **__0.14 __**__**+ 253**__ - 18400 = 58\n\n⇒ **__253.14 - 18400__** = 58\n\n⇒ -18146.86 ≠ 58\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 2\".",
